With these changes:

- The outer `<div>` is now announced as a button widget.
- It carries `aria-expanded=true|false`.
- It is labelled by the contents of the “above-the-fold” `<span>`, which now has an ID. So on entering the region, VO/JAWS will read “Above the fold content”.
- Keyboard events use `onKeyDown` so Space/Enter will toggle expansion as expected.
